[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1914450965","pull_request_review_id":2549116643,"id":1914450965,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5yHDQV","diff_hunk":"@@ -184,12 +184,21 @@ bool Control::_edit_use_rect() const {\n \n void Control::reparent(Node *p_parent, bool p_keep_global_transform) {\n \tERR_MAIN_THREAD_GUARD;\n+\tViewport *vp = get_viewport();","path":"scene/gui/control.cpp","commit_id":"7a0e758253f4d98cb2aed95d9b925c7f78dbc48d","original_commit_id":"636aa9209b261b52605453cacd06cf3daf832be8","user":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"From a quick look, this will likely make problems, if you reparent a Control node to a different viewport. ","created_at":"2025-01-14T08:49:31Z","updated_at":"2025-01-14T08:49:32Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101527#discussion_r1914450965","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101527","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1914450965"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101527#discussion_r1914450965"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101527"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1914450965/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":null,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":4,"position":4,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1914622568","pull_request_review_id":2549393636,"id":1914622568,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5yHtJo","diff_hunk":"@@ -184,12 +184,21 @@ bool Control::_edit_use_rect() const {\n \n void Control::reparent(Node *p_parent, bool p_keep_global_transform) {\n \tERR_MAIN_THREAD_GUARD;\n+\tViewport *vp = get_viewport();","path":"scene/gui/control.cpp","commit_id":"7a0e758253f4d98cb2aed95d9b925c7f78dbc48d","original_commit_id":"636aa9209b261b52605453cacd06cf3daf832be8","user":{"login":"badsectoracula","id":20316467,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzE2NDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20316467?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula","html_url":"https://github.com/badsectoracula","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I did consider it but i wasn't sure if it'd be a problem in practice.\r\n\r\nThe `Viewport` class should in theory be able to handle a request to reparent to another viewport instance (so a call to `_gui_reparent_control` with a new parent that belongs to a different viewport should still work). This means that the code here should work regardless.\r\n\r\nThe PR's code in `Viewport::_gui_reparent_control` only checks if the control has mouse or key focus and in practice it shouldn't happen that a mouse button (or key) is pressed on a control and that control then is reparented to another viewport. Of course technically it can happen, i just can't think of a scenario.\r\n\r\nBut thinking about it a bit more, it turns out a fix for this is simple: just get the new viewport instance after reparenting and update the fields for that instance instead of `self`. So i updated the code for that method to do that and now it should handle the case of reparenting to a different viewport.","created_at":"2025-01-14T10:54:14Z","updated_at":"2025-01-14T10:54:14Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101527#discussion_r1914622568","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101527","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1914622568"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101527#discussion_r1914622568"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101527"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1914622568/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":null,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1914450965,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":4,"position":4,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1929317059","pull_request_review_id":2573712401,"id":1929317059,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5y_wrD","diff_hunk":"@@ -184,12 +184,21 @@ bool Control::_edit_use_rect() const {\n \n void Control::reparent(Node *p_parent, bool p_keep_global_transform) {\n \tERR_MAIN_THREAD_GUARD;\n+\tViewport *vp = get_viewport();","path":"scene/gui/control.cpp","commit_id":"7a0e758253f4d98cb2aed95d9b925c7f78dbc48d","original_commit_id":"636aa9209b261b52605453cacd06cf3daf832be8","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I tested reparenting to SubViewport and the behavior does not look correct.\r\nHere's a modified MRP:\r\n[GUIInputTest.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18542622/GUIInputTest.zip)\r\nAlthough maybe the example is wrong and it's not supposed to work, idk.","created_at":"2025-01-24T22:32:19Z","updated_at":"2025-01-24T22:32:19Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101527#discussion_r1929317059","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101527","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1929317059"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101527#discussion_r1929317059"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101527"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1929317059/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":null,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1914450965,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":4,"position":4,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1929325238","pull_request_review_id":2573725142,"id":1929325238,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5y_yq2","diff_hunk":"@@ -184,12 +184,21 @@ bool Control::_edit_use_rect() const {\n \n void Control::reparent(Node *p_parent, bool p_keep_global_transform) {\n \tERR_MAIN_THREAD_GUARD;\n+\tViewport *vp = get_viewport();","path":"scene/gui/control.cpp","commit_id":"7a0e758253f4d98cb2aed95d9b925c7f78dbc48d","original_commit_id":"636aa9209b261b52605453cacd06cf3daf832be8","user":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I would consider reparenting to a different Viewport as a very obscure feature.\r\nWhile I don't believe, that mouse key state needs to be preserved in this case, we should make sure, that the state is kept consistent and not introduce bugs.\r\nSo perhaps a simple approach would be to\r\n- preserve the states when reparenting in the same viewport and\r\n- simply clear the states when reparenting to a different viewport\r\n","created_at":"2025-01-24T22:40:56Z","updated_at":"2025-01-24T22:40:57Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101527#discussion_r1929325238","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101527","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1929325238"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101527#discussion_r1929325238"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101527"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1929325238/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":null,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1914450965,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":4,"position":4,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1941817072","pull_request_review_id":2593912444,"id":1941817072,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5zvcbw","diff_hunk":"@@ -184,12 +184,21 @@ bool Control::_edit_use_rect() const {\n \n void Control::reparent(Node *p_parent, bool p_keep_global_transform) {\n \tERR_MAIN_THREAD_GUARD;\n+\tViewport *vp = get_viewport();","path":"scene/gui/control.cpp","commit_id":"7a0e758253f4d98cb2aed95d9b925c7f78dbc48d","original_commit_id":"636aa9209b261b52605453cacd06cf3daf832be8","user":{"login":"badsectoracula","id":20316467,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzE2NDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20316467?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula","html_url":"https://github.com/badsectoracula","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I looked into this again and, yeah, reparenting to a different Viewport isn't as simple as i thought - mainly because the \"release\" event goes into the viewport on which the \"press\" event was made and not the viewport under which the mouse is located. While this could be solved by keeping track in a global \"pending release events\" list that is filled during reparenting and checked by viewports whenever a release event comes so that they forward the event to the control's viewport, i'm not sure if the hack:worth ratio is small enough to warrant it :-P.\r\n\r\nSo instead i modified the code to simply clear the state and send the appropriate events whenever a control that has a mouse down focus or key focus changes viewport. That was also a bit more involved than i originally thought since the `reparent` call can come from the middle of a `press` handler so the `release` events should be deferred until after the handler is finished to avoid putting controls in a \"mixed\" state.\r\n\r\nThe current PR should handle both (or at least not leave controls in an intermediate or mixed state), though implementing drag-and-drop via reparenting across viewports in a press handler still wont be possible. But i'm not sure how desirable or common that'd be in practice.","created_at":"2025-02-04T20:03:08Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T20:03:08Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101527#discussion_r1941817072","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101527","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1941817072"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101527#discussion_r1941817072"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101527"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1941817072/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":null,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1914450965,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":4,"position":4,"subject_type":"line"}]